    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Secrets\" title=\"Force Secrets\">Force Secrets</a></i> </p><p>When you activate a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to corrupt the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>. The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> gains the [<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Side\">Dark Side</a></i>] descriptor, and opponents who have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a> lower than yours take a -2 penalty to all <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defense_Scores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Defense Scores\">Defense Scores</a> against this activation of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>. </p><p>Alternatively, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Destiny_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Destiny Point\">Destiny Point</a> to increase the penalty to opponents' <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defense_Scores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Defense Scores\">Defense Scores</a> to -5. You cannot use this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Secret\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Secret\">Force Secret</a> unless your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a> equals your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> score. </p><p><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Powers\" title=\"Force Powers\">Force Powers</a> that have the [<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Light_Side\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Light Side\">Light Side</a></i>] descriptor cannot be corrupted by the use of this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Secret\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Secret\">Force Secret</a>. </p>",
